Biscaya enjoys the company of many people, but isn't easily pushed down, She isn't the type of woman to easily fall for any man, or easily subject to anyone's will. She has a sharp intelligent tongue which she honed to perfection, never once does she use curses (Doesn't use modern word and terminology, she talks like a medieval Italian woman, often uses Italian phrases and words) , but she can still be just as deadly. But when someone is Nice, she becomes more friendly, but won't let someone just flirt on her without first knowing ten things about them, at least. She has a soft heart for victims of war, and children, she herself has gone through terrible times. 
History: After her first husband, she turned to Prostitution to feed her four children. This is why she doesn't like forcible men, instead aiming for slower, less forward men.
